Scan your own repos with VVAH

Usage: wally vvah [OPTIONS] [args...]

Arguments:
  args                        VVAH's own command and options; with none, scan
                              --repo . --remediate

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
  -m, --model TEXT            A model from your account (default: your default
                              model)

Examples:
  # Scan the current repo you are authorised to test
  wally vvah

  # Scan another path with a chosen model
  wally vvah -m glm-5.3-flash -- scan --repo ./my-repo

  # Other VVAH commands pass through
  wally vvah -- report
